# Pointer calibration, then absolute positioning on click, taps, scrolling and relative motion.
expect Pointer calibrated
expect Lab: PASS \[Lab iPhone 1\] pointer near \(0\.25, 0\.70\)
expect Lab: \[Lab iPhone 1\] tap at
expect Lab: \[Lab iPhone 1\] scroll 3
expect-not Lab: FAIL
0     video ../fixtures/portrait.h265
1500  focus
2000  key ctrl+shift+p
4000  click-pointer
5000  click 0.25 0.70
7000  expect-pointer 0.25 0.70 0.03
7500  click 0.5 0.5
8000  wheel 3
8500  move 120 0
9000  key ctrl+alt
9500  quit
